        <mxCell id="a1p2" value="The two most pressing are health (insulin coolers for elderly) and education (after-school tutoring for ALS learners). Captain Lolomboy approved both within the last 14 days." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=20;spacingTop=76;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="240" y="150" width="900" height="44" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
